From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kiritantakechi <kiritantakechi@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] base-files: Orbyt's banner

The login banner shows Orbyt's name in place of OpenWrt's art; the
release line below it, which the build fills in from the version
options, stays (orbyt-brand D3).

Signed-off-by: kiritantakechi <kiritantakechi@gmail.com>
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Orbyt's identity]
---
 package/base-files/files/etc/banner | 11 ++++++-----
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/package/base-files/files/etc/banner b/package/base-files/files/etc/banner
index f3af3c0..e046e1a 100644
--- a/package/base-files/files/etc/banner
+++ b/package/base-files/files/etc/banner
@@ -1,8 +1,9 @@
